WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.710
Jerusalem, just after Pentecost.

2
00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:06.000
A small group of believers
meets every day to pray,

3
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:08.570
eat together and share what they have.

4
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:12.560
By the 4th century, the faith had
spread across the Roman Empire,

5
00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:13.940
even to Britain.

6
00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.580
But Ireland was never part of the Empire.

7
00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:18.350
It lay across the sea.

8
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:23.190
So how did a faith that began with a
few people in Jerusalem reach Ireland?

9
00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:26.840
In this mission, you'll find six
marks of the first Christians,

10
00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:30.260
from preaching to sharing,
each with a source.

11
00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:34.420
Then you'll follow the life of
Patrick on a timeline and a map.

12
00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:37.760
Your mission: find out how
the faith reached Ireland,

13
00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:39.240
and who carried it there.
